        "text": "Joyce Slaton, C.P.S.T.",
        "text_sha256": "585a34c69975df3c7ad98f3a7d8b6ea72ca0854e8f983f8ac741a9bc9261dcfa",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Joyce Slaton, C.P.S.T.",
        "text_sha256": "557a37501ca9b1d6122670131a7caca3ec8b4a7836d699093dfa25f75ec6b88b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Joyce Slaton is a certified Child Passenger Safety Technician (C.P.S.T.) and expert in car seat safety. She is certified to install and check child passenger restraints, as well as educate parents on installing and using car seats.",
        "text_sha256": "140328dda2129a54c438afaab9c0ca91036778d8b40c7ed8927dae095ceb8be8",
        "word_count": 37
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Slaton has been a C.P.S.T. since 2016, and in that time has installed and gotten to know hundreds of car seats.",
        "text_sha256": "bf6143ff0f11e99faf02748dfee1eb677bee05031b8889ff50961c4da40e68a2",
        "word_count": 21
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Slaton graduated from the University of Florida with a degree in journalism.",
        "text_sha256": "10e083fc2727c5ea94edee9d9a3456587cfe76781d2bb769369109afcd004568",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Aside from being a C.P.S.T., Slaton has been writing about parenting, pregnancy, baby products and women's health since 2004. She is a member of Safe Kids Worldwide.",
        "text_sha256": "2fcf0d006023f9595221395811675a4c5c5a5df9b7af854aea5913e33661af85",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
